{
  "skillId": "patent-parameter-extraction",
  "displayName": "专利参数提取",
  "description": "专利参数提取、实施例参数、工艺条件表。当用户要从指定专利中整理温度、时间、配比、结构尺寸或实验指标时使用，保留条件和出处，不直接做效果排名。 Extract process settings, compositions and test results from supplied patent specifications, linking each value to its example, conditions, original unit and source passage.",
  "verificationClass": "official-clawhub",
